    "ct_materials_main": {
      "type": "ct-materials",
      "blocks": {
        "material_1": {
          "type": "material",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Non-stick",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/okx-pan-nonstick-real.webp",
            "badge": "PFAS coating",
            "title": "Non-stick pan",
            "text": "<p>Great on day one. But that coating is PTFE, and it doesn't like heat or forks. Once it's damaged, you're cooking on something that slowly comes apart.</p>",
            "stat_1_label": "Releases",
            "stat_1_value": "PFAS fumes, flakes",
            "stat_2_label": "When",
            "stat_2_value": "High heat or scratches",
            "stat_3_label": "Risk",
            "stat_3_value": "High",
            "positive": false,
            "point_1": "PTFE/PFAS chemical coating",
            "point_2": "Damaged by high heat",
            "point_3": "Gets into your food once scratched"
          }
        },
        "material_2": {
          "type": "material",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Stainless steel",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/okx-pan-stainless-real.webp",
            "badge": "Leaches metals",
            "title": "Stainless steel pan",
            "text": "<p>A kitchen workhorse with a catch: your bolognese and lemon chicken can pull small amounts of nickel and chromium out of it. Add sticky eggs and a steep learning curve.</p>",
            "stat_1_label": "Releases",
            "stat_1_value": "Nickel & chromium",
            "stat_2_label": "When",
            "stat_2_value": "Acidic food, long simmers",
            "stat_3_label": "Risk",
            "stat_3_value": "Medium",
            "positive": false,
            "point_1": "Can release nickel & chromium",
            "point_2": "Eggs and fish stick",
            "point_3": "Needs practice"
          }
        },
        "material_3": {
          "type": "material",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Cast iron",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/okx-pan-castiron-real.jpg",
            "badge": "High upkeep",
            "title": "Cast iron pan",
            "text": "<p>Loved for searing, but it asks a lot: seasoning, drying, oiling, no soap. Miss a step and you're scraping rust, and acidic dishes take on a metallic taste.</p>",
            "stat_1_label": "Releases",
            "stat_1_value": "Iron & rust",
            "stat_2_label": "When",
            "stat_2_value": "Acidic food, worn seasoning",
            "stat_3_label": "Risk",
            "stat_3_value": "Medium",
            "positive": false,
            "point_1": "Constant seasoning",
            "point_2": "Rust if left wet",
            "point_3": "Heavy on the wrist"
          }
        },
        "material_4": {
          "type": "material",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Ceramic",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/okx-pan-ceramic-real.jpg",
            "badge": "Wears out fast",
            "title": "Ceramic pan",
            "text": "<p>Marketed as the clean choice, yet the slick layer is thin and short-lived. A few months of real cooking and it starts losing grip, chipping and exposing the metal below.</p>",
            "stat_1_label": "Releases",
            "stat_1_value": "Coating chips",
            "stat_2_label": "When",
            "stat_2_value": "Within months",
            "stat_3_label": "Risk",
            "stat_3_value": "Medium",
            "positive": false,
            "point_1": "Non-stick fades in months",
            "point_2": "Surface can chip",
            "point_3": "Short lifespan"
          }
        },
        "material_5": {
          "type": "material",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Hybrid",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/okx-pan-hybrid-real.jpg",
            "badge": "Still coated",
            "title": "Hybrid pan",
            "text": "<p>The steel grid on top looks reassuring. The non-stick underneath is the same PTFE you were trying to get away from, and it ages exactly the same way.</p>",
            "stat_1_label": "Releases",
            "stat_1_value": "PFAS fumes, flakes",
            "stat_2_label": "When",
            "stat_2_value": "As the coating wears",
            "stat_3_label": "Risk",
            "stat_3_value": "High",
            "positive": false,
            "point_1": "PTFE hidden under the grid",
            "point_2": "Coating still wears",
            "point_3": "Premium price, same issue"
          }
        },
        "material_6": {
          "type": "material",
          "settings": {
            "name": "CookingTitan",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/okura-hand-hammered-titanium-pan-01-hero_b39de0b9-8d90-4371-8208-13d68b6c9638.webp",
            "badge": "Coating-free",
            "title": "CookingTitan titanium pan",
            "text": "<p>No coating, no seasoning, no compromise. Just a hammered titanium surface that stays the same, whatever you cook, however hot you go, whatever utensil you grab.</p>",
            "stat_1_label": "Releases",
            "stat_1_value": "Nothing",
            "stat_2_label": "When",
            "stat_2_value": "At any heat",
            "stat_3_label": "Risk",
            "stat_3_value": "None",
            "positive": true,
            "point_1": "Titanium cooking surface",
            "point_2": "Nothing to wear thin",
            "point_3": "Nothing added to your food"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "material_1",
        "material_2",
        "material_3",
        "material_4",
        "material_5",
        "material_6"
      ],
      "settings": {
